0548                             ; ekey: wait for a key
0548   CD D7 03     EKEY:     CALL   rawk   
054B   28 FB                  JR   Z,ekey   
054D   C9                     RET      
054E                             ; The command keys, and where each goes (after fin).
054E   0D           CMDS:     DB   13   
054F   A8 05                  DW   cret   
0551   07                     DB   7   ; ^G
0552   F0 05                  DW   crun   
0554   0C                     DB   12   ; ^L
0555   02 06                  DW   clist   
