0567   00 00                  DW   LEAVE   
0569                NCMD:     EQU   9   
0569                             ; ^N ^N: no program, if the next key is ^N too
0569   CD 48 05     CNEW:     CALL   ekey   
056C   FE 0E                  CP   14   
056E   20 04                  JR   NZ,ged0   
0570   AF                     XOR   A   
0571   32 00 0B               LD   (PROG),A   
0574   C3 A8 04     GED0:     JP   edit   
0577                             ; ^E: line n goes into the input line, to be changed. EDLN remembers which
0577                             ; line it was: Return puts the text back in its place.
0577   CD 06 03     CEDLN:    CALL   rdnum   
057A   E5                     PUSH   HL   
